    <h3>🛍️ For Physical Products</h3>

    <!-- Prompt 1 -->
    <div class="prompt-card">
      <div class="prompt-card-header">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <div>
          <div class="title">Lifestyle Product (General)</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.8rem;opacity:0.85;">
            <span class="platform-tag" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#fff;">Shopify</span>
            <span class="platform-tag" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);color:#fff;">General</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <pre class="prompt-code">Write a product description for [PRODUCT NAME].

Buyer: [describe target customer in 1-2 sentences — age, lifestyle, pain point]
Features: [list 4-6 key features]
Transformation: Before using this product, the customer feels [X]. After, they feel [Y].
Top buyer objection: [name the #1 hesitation]
Trust signals: [reviews count, certifications, guarantee, sourcing]
Tone: [conversational/luxurious/playful/technical]
Length: 150-200 words
Platform: Shopify product page

Reframe every feature as a specific customer benefit. Address the buyer 
objection naturally within the copy. End with a soft CTA that creates 
urgency without being pushy.</pre>
      <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyPrompt(this)">📋 Copy Prompt</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Prompt 2 -->
    <div class="prompt-card">
      <div class="prompt-card-header">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <div>
          <div class="title">Amazon Listing (A+ Content Ready)</div>
